## Layout

- `src/portal/consent.ts` — explicit consent receipts (grant + revoke)
- `src/portal/messaging.ts` — patient ↔ provider secure messaging
- `db/migrations/001_portal_init.sql` — denormalized consent-receipt
  view + message_thread + message tables

## Pack: healthcare

When the healthcare pack is enabled on the tenant, the platform enforces:

- Every PHI write goes through `sdk-vault` envelope encryption (no
  raw PHI in any column).
- Every PHI access writes to the `sdk-audit` chain — HIPAA §164.312(b)
  Audit Controls + 21 CFR Part 11.
- `sdk-data-rights` consumes `consent.revoked.v1` and fans erasure
  out to every store keyed by the subject.

